{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19984","headline":"蓝溪元居士草堂 · 孟郊","name":"蓝溪元居士草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"市井不容义，义归山谷中。\n夫君宅松桂，招我栖蒙笼。\n人朴情虑肃，境闲视听空。\n清溪宛转水，修竹徘徊风。\n木倦采樵子，土劳稼穑翁。\n读书业虽异，敦本志亦同。\n蓝岸青漠漠，蓝峰碧崇崇。\n日昏各命酒，寒蛩鸣蕙丛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19984.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19984","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}